33 0 obj
<< /Length 1420 >>
stream
0.8 w 30.00 38.00 535.28 765.89 re S
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 280.14 22.00 Tm (Page 14) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 772.00 Tm (7. DATABASE NORMALIZATION) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 735.00 Tm (Third Normal Form \(3NF\): Transitive dependencies are removed. Company information) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 717.00 Tm (is stored in companies and referenced from jobs. Student account credentials are) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 699.00 Tm (stored in users, while academic profile information is stored in students.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 673.00 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 673.00 Tm (The design avoids storing company names repeatedly in every job record.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 650.00 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 650.00 Tm (The design avoids storing student login credentials repeatedly in placement) Tj ET
