BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 699.00 Tm (normalized tables, primary keys, foreign keys, unique constraints, transactions,) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 681.00 Tm (joins, aggregate queries, secure authentication, and role-based access control.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 655.00 Tm (The project improves placement management by centralizing records, reducing) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 637.00 Tm (duplicate data, enabling secure access, and providing useful analytics for) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 619.00 Tm (placement administrators. It also provides students with a structured way to view) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 601.00 Tm (jobs, apply for opportunities, and track interviews.) Tj ET
